[00:17.71]Pal pal jeena muhal
[00:20.17]Mera tere bina
[00:22.10]Ye sary nashe bekaar
[00:24.75]Teri ankhon kay siwa
[00:26.84]Ghar nahi jata mein bahar
[00:29.25]Rehta tera intazar
[00:31.68]Mere, khwabon mein aa na
[00:33.87]Kakry sola singhaar
[00:36.14]Mein ab kyu hosh mein ata ni
[00:38.28]Sukoon ye dil kyu pata ni
[00:40.28]Kyu toru khud say jo thy wade kay ab ye ishq nibahana nahi
