[00:49.54]Ye duniya janay mera dard tujhe ye nazar kyu ata nahi
[00:54.24]Soneya yu tera sharmana meri jaan na lele
[00:58.78]Kaan ke peechy zulf chupana meri jan kya kehnay
[01:03.56]Zalima toba tera nakhra iske war kya kehne
[01:08.02]Tham ky bethe dil ko ghayal kaheen har na bethein
[01:12.87]Teri nazrien mujhsy kya kehti hen
[01:15.73]Inme wafa bethi hay
